# Copy to .env and fill in. Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# WARNING: with Vite this key is bundled into the browser and visible in devtools.
# That is fine for localhost-only use. Before hosting this anywhere, replace it
# with an ephemeral-token endpoint (see README) so the real key never ships.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
